From 6d29976569aec76a27bcf75f9425d14dda30de8d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 02:31:46 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(kanban): worker nodes run other gateways' cards through
 Board leases; runs_on placement (#137)

Worker nodes (card runs): runs_on placement, pickup through Board leases (kanban.sync.pickup explicit|true), creator-side held_elsewhere. CI: the only failures are ones main carries too (web_server.py Windows footguns; test_session_detail_malformed_db, test_history_commentary_display, tests/pm/test_source_update_launch fail identically on other PRs off main: runs 40654732974, 40654072745, 40651636161); kanban suites, ruff and the code-health ratchet pass.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
